{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>וישתמר</b> — each one of the statutes of Omri." "<b>וכל מעשה בית אחאב</b> — they are the ones who keep, and My statutes they do not keep." "<b>וחרפת עמי</b> — the meaning is: that which you used to shame the servants of HaShem, you shall bear the recompense. Or the meaning is: the shame of My people you shall bear upon yourselves, in the manner of וחרפה לא נשא על קרובו (Leviticus 20:20)."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:11.330339249Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}